### Koda E-Wallet Weekly 6 - REST Client (VS Code extension "REST Client")
### Data seed (database baru): user Id 1-10 (Andi..Joko), wallet WAL001..WAL010,
### top up PENDING milik Fitri (user 6) = TopUpRequestId 5.

@host = http://localhost:5063

### 1. Metode pembayaran aktif
GET {{host}}/api/v1/payment-methods

### 2. Info wallet Andi (saldo awal seed Rp800.000)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/wallets/1

### 3. Buat user baru -> wallet ACTIVE saldo 0 otomatis
POST {{host}}/api/v1/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"username": "kevin",
	"fullName": "Kevin",
	"email": "kevin@mail.com",
	"phone": "081200000011"
}

### 4. Buat user duplikat (username/email/phone sama) -> 409
POST {{host}}/api/v1/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"username": "kevin",
	"fullName": "Kevin Lagi",
	"email": "kevin2@mail.com",
	"phone": "081200000099"
}

### 5. Ajukan top up Andi -> PENDING, saldo belum berubah (catat topUpRequestId)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/wallets/1/topups
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"amount": 100000,
	"paymentMethodCode": "BANK_TRANSFER",
	"description": "Top up uji"
}

### 6. Saldo Andi masih sama (belum berubah)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/wallets/1

### 7. Konfirmasi pembayaran (ganti 5 dengan topUpRequestId dari langkah 5) -> PAID/SUCCESS, saldo naik
POST {{host}}/api/v1/topups/5/confirm

### 8. Konfirmasi ulang top up yang sama -> 409 (tidak boleh diproses ulang)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/topups/5/confirm

### 9. Transfer Andi -> Budi (WAL002) berhasil
POST {{host}}/api/v1/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"senderUserId": 1,
	"receiverWalletNumber": "WAL002",
	"amount": 50000,
	"description": "Uji transfer"
}

### 10. Transfer melebihi saldo -> 422 + audit TRANSFER_REJECTED, saldo tidak berubah (ROLLBACK / ditolak)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"senderUserId": 1,
	"receiverWalletNumber": "WAL002",
	"amount": 999000000,
	"description": "Terlalu besar"
}

### 11. Transfer ke wallet tidak ada -> 404 + audit REJECTED
POST {{host}}/api/v1/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"senderUserId": 1,
	"receiverWalletNumber": "WAL999",
	"amount": 10000
}

### 12. Transfer ke diri sendiri -> 400 + audit REJECTED
POST {{host}}/api/v1/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"senderUserId": 1,
	"receiverWalletNumber": "WAL001",
	"amount": 10000
}

### 13. Histori transaksi Andi: halaman 1, 5 data per halaman
GET {{host}}/api/v1/users/1/transactions?page=1&pageSize=5

### 14. Histori transaksi: filter + search + sorting
GET {{host}}/api/v1/users/1/transactions?type=TRANSFER&status=SUCCESS&direction=OUT&search=TRF&sortBy=amount&sortDir=asc&dateFrom=2026-11-01&dateTo=2026-12-31

### 15. Histori mutasi Andi (saldo sebelum / sesudah)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/users/1/mutations?page=1&pageSize=10

### 16. Histori mutasi: hanya IN
GET {{host}}/api/v1/users/1/mutations?direction=IN&sortBy=createdAt&sortDir=desc

### 17. Pagination tidak valid -> 400
GET {{host}}/api/v1/users/1/transactions?page=0&pageSize=500

### 18. Audit logs terbaru
GET {{host}}/api/v1/audit-logs?page=1&pageSize=20


################################################################
### UJI CONCURRENCY (RowVersion) - buat dua top up untuk wallet yang sama
################################################################

### A. Top up pertama Citra (catat id = X)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/wallets/3/topups
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 10000, "paymentMethodCode": "QRIS" }

### B. Top up kedua Citra (catat id = Y)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/wallets/3/topups
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 20000, "paymentMethodCode": "QRIS" }

### C. Konfirmasi X dengan jeda 10 detik (JALANKAN INI DULU, jangan ditunggu)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/topups/X/confirm?delayMs=10000

### D. Dalam 10 detik itu, konfirmasi Y tanpa jeda -> berhasil 200
POST {{host}}/api/v1/topups/Y/confirm

### Hasil C: 409 Conflict (wallet sudah diubah oleh D). Cek: top up X tetap PENDING, tidak ada mutasi/audit untuk X.
GET {{host}}/api/v1/users/3/transactions?type=TOPUP
